select 
a.name, 
sum(coalesce(b.distance, 0)) as travelled_distance
from 
users a
left join
rides b
on a.id=b.user_id
group by b.user_id
order by travelled_distance desc, name asc

-- R1
select
name,
coalesce(sum(distance),0) as travelled_distance
from rides a 
right join users b
on a.user_id=b.id
group by a.user_id
order by 2 desc, 1 asc